+       =(?,\alpha,\beta,?,\sum_{i\in S_P}p_i),\qquad
+ R_P={B\sum_{i\in S_P}p_i\over\alpha\beta\mu_P},
+\tag{4}
+\]
+where both \(S_P\) and the two question marks are unfiled.  Reporting a numeric
+\(R_P\) for such a row would manufacture data.
