+ (?,\alpha,\beta,?,\mathbf p),\quad
+ \sum\mathbf p=td,\quad
+ \max_P R_P\geq\bar R:={td\over\alpha\beta}
+\tag{5}
+\]
+**if** the row has a Keller realization.  It does not give the rootwise
+partition required in (4).
