+| M26 | 12/2 | (3,5) | [6;1,2,5]\(^2\) | (5,5,1,1) | 4/5 | L; \((3,5)\) list-relative dead |
+| M27 | 12/2 | (5,6) | [6;1,1,5]\(^2\) | (6,6) | 2/5 | B |
