+1. **additive pole-mass growth:** \(td/(\alpha\beta)\to\infty\), already present
+   formally at fixed type \((2,3)\);
+2. **light-root concentration:** a fixed positive pole mass lands at roots with
+   \(\mu_P/B\to0\).
