+  explicitly said otherwise.
+
+The exact root formula is
+\[
+ R_P={B\Delta_P\over\alpha\beta\mu_P},\qquad
+ \Delta_P=\sum_{\gamma\mid P,\ {\rm pole}}p_\gamma .
+\tag{1}
